  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Affiliate of a Lender is mentioned as a party who may require consent for assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Affiliate refers to a related entity with an office in the United States that may serve as a successor agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Affiliate thereof in such proceedings under any Debtor Relief Laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any company related to the Borrower or Company as per the Agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity that is related to the Lender, typically through ownership or control."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Affiliates of the Administrative Agent may engage in transactions unrelated to the Agreement that could impact interest rate calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Subsidiary or Affiliate thereof"&lt;SEP&gt;"any business entity that is related to the Administrative Agent, Borrower, or Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"in the case of an assignment to a Lender, an Affiliate of a Lender or an Approved Fund."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, with respect to a specified Person, another Person that directly, or indirectly through one or more intermediaries, Controls or is Controlled by or is under common Control with the Person specified."</data>
