<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A currency other than the primary currency being used in the agreement or transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"A currency that is not the US Dollar, used in exchange agreements and financial transactions described within the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Currency is a term used for currencies other than the standard currency (e.g., US Dollars) used in the loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any other dealings in the applicable Alternative Currency of such RFR Loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Currency other than the primary currency employed, including Euro, Yen, and others."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans be made in a currency other than US Dollars and the currencies specifically listed in the definition of 'Alternative Currency'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in any Alternative Currency shall be prepaid by the applicable Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment amount in a currency other than US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to currencies other than the domestic currency used for loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to currencies other than the primary currency specified in a loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"any Loan (or interest due thereon) denominated in an Alternative Currency on its scheduled due date."&lt;SEP&gt;"any currency that can be used as an alternative in the relevant interbank market under this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"in the case of Loans denominated in any Alternative Currency, such request shall be ineffective."&lt;SEP&gt;"means Euro, Sterling, Yen, Canadian Dollars, Australian Dollars, Swiss Francs and each other currency (other than US Dollars) that is approved in accordance with Section 1.05."&lt;SEP&gt;"payment by the Borrowers hereunder with respect to principal of and interest on Loans denominated in an Alternative Currency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-55b2896fc19ee92000ef6c8ffa2b237a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34eaba7aa393831d52ae42e0a132d620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f5ad49f8201d6b0a3fcd9f24a173bff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46b17dc38cedefc3b1d4ee3fb0408407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf8265680b576d949a33956718f4bea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab70c1cf5fa53da3db1e0969d425127&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0264408b13fa227639776ebb2dea19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1fe6dedd3de03de6a01be405d8196f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4618ecc33dccdd0d44eedddbd072848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decc7f4374f137eff5fab6d32d23ffb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30c831ae2ececd9089c39cf051b149e</data>
