<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SONIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate for Loans denominated in Sterling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR, the Daily Simple SONIA or the Daily Simple SARON, as applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SONIA is a benchmark for overnight interest rates in the UK market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each SONIA Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Simple SONIA plus the Applicable Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rate used for the SONIA Loan based on daily calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, for any day with respect to any Loan denominated in Sterling, an interest rate per annum equal to the greater of SONIA for the day..."</data>
