  <data key="d1">"Daily Simple SONIA is referenced with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Sterling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each SONIA Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate per annum equal to the Sterling Overnight Index Average for such Business Day published by the SONIA Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"if the RFR for such Benchmark is SONIA or Daily Simple SOFR, then four RFR Business Days prior to such setting."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to the Sterling Overnight Index Average, which is a benchmark interest rate for overnight loans in the British pound currency."</data>
