<node id="&quot;OUTSTANDING AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Aggregate outstanding face amount of letters of credit secured by permitted Liens shall not exceed US$1,500,000,000."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers shall prepay Loans to reduce the Outstanding Amount to a specified limit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outstanding Amount of all Loans denominated in Alternative Currencies at such time exceeds an amount equal to 105% of the Alternative Currency Sublimit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the sum of the US Dollar Equivalents of the outstanding principal amount of Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The aggregate Outstanding Amount refers to the total principal amount of Loans that remain unpaid."</data>
