<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Default occurs when the Borrower or Company fails to meet certain financial obligations or representations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A situation or condition referred to in the Agreement that indicates a failure to comply with specific obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to a situation where the Borrower fails to meet its obligations as per the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default signifies a failure to meet obligations as outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each notice pursuant to this Section shall be accompanied by a statement of a Responsible Officer setting forth details of the occurrence referred to therein."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Default shall exist, or would result from such proposed Borrowing or from the application of the proceeds thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall not have any duty to take any discretionary action or exercise any discretionary powers, except discretionary rights and powers expressly contemplated hereby or by the other Loan Documents that the Administrative Agent is required to exercise as directed in writing by the Required Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The existence of a Default condition can trigger requests for additional financial information from Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Default' refers to a failure to fulfill a contractual obligation under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"any event or condition that constitutes an Event of Default or could become one with the appropriate circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"condition resulting from the failure to meet obligations under the Agreement or Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40c9da145f3e45db09eb70b219243579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-231a0d0a9307dfd95b4523972c93623b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10aab01983c7602494d5f25b52cc07d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8890e5da0c89b8e12882c5f4bdf02be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c914ecc1ba4cc04797717a927d91fd0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452c2953347bc2f086e4d6b4155670f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d019c3df8aed44c5ff8ea4da836ddf9d</data>
