  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliates are understood in the context of the agreement and obligations described."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates may accept deposits from, lend money to, own securities of, and generally engage in various business activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates of each Lender, including successors and/or assigns, are considered in compliance with the Agreement unless noted otherwise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to any associated entities that have a formal business relationship with the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to entities that have a close relationship with the Administrative Agent, Arranger, and Lenders, which may involve shared interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to related entities of the Recipients that may affect liability concerning gross negligence or misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates represent entities that have a related but independent status from the Company and are mentioned in the context of assignment restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates’ understanding and engagement in the agreements and transactions is specified."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company, any Borrower or any such Person’s Subsidiaries or other Affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities related to the lenders or agents through ownership or control."&lt;SEP&gt;"Such Person’s Affiliates are included in the definition of Related Parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent or any of its Affiliates..."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any of its Affiliates involved in agreements with the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to entities associated with the Administrative Agent that may also incur expenses."</data>
