  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any Borrower is required to pay any Indemnified Taxes or additional amounts to any Lender or any Governmental Authority for the account of any Lender pursuant to Section 3.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes are amounts that Borrowers may be required to pay under certain circumstances involving Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes are taxes that the Lender agrees to indemnify the Administrative Agent and Borrowers against under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes payable or paid by such Recipient or required to be withheld or deducted from a payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes imposed on or with respect to any payment made by or related to the obligations of any borrower under loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are to be indemnified, meaning the borrower commits to covering costs related to certain taxes for the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"withholding or deduction is made on account of Indemnified Taxes, the sum payable by the applicable Borrower shall be increased."</data>
