<node id="&quot;BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Borrowing' refers to the action of obtaining capital through loans, such as Base Rate Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A general term referring to funds that are borrowed, which may include various types like SONIA and SARON Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowing refers to instances where funds are drawn based on the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans comprising each such portion shall be considered a separate Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the act of obtaining funds from the Lender under the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The act of taking a loan from the Lender by the Borrower as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Borrowing” means Loans of the same Type, in the same Agreed Currency and to the same Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-55b2896fc19ee92000ef6c8ffa2b237a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40c9da145f3e45db09eb70b219243579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbdf531655886df91c6a944df9d3f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23aa4dfdccf3a6a169a3556f56d5601f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4fe896846cd167076f22c0725da64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbaf061a5d10dddff589ed1a422c891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f5ad49f8201d6b0a3fcd9f24a173bff</data>
