<node id="&quot;LOAN NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Notice is a document that details the principal amounts and currency for loans requested by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Loan Notice is a written notice that the Borrower must deliver to the Administrative Agent to request a loan or conversion."&lt;SEP&gt;"A notice regarding borrowing of Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"If the applicable Borrower fails to specify a Type of Loan in a Loan Notice or if the applicable Borrower fails to give a timely notice requesting a conversion or continuation of any Term Benchmark Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Notice requests for the making of or conversion to an affected Loan borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall have received a Loan Notice in accordance with the requirements hereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documentation specifying the details of the loan request, including amounts and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The notice submitted by the Borrower to specify the terms of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of each Lender to honor any Loan Notice is subject to specific conditions precedent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbdf531655886df91c6a944df9d3f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec07a1eab7686ab6eef9aa9d7515a3e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4fe896846cd167076f22c0725da64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69954b308816d8f15f00d6a218095eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29f4c749687effde35d0fcb513406dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1de73b3018151cf03fd33ccbe0fd5885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
