<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest shall accrue on each Loan for the day on which such Loan is made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate applicable for the calculation of interest payments in accordance with the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section details how the interest rate is set and modified according to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount charged by a lender to a borrower for the use of an asset, expressed as a percentage of the principal."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate on a Loan may be derived from an interest rate benchmark and is subject to regulatory reform and changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage of the loan that is charged as interest on the principal sum."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate of interest related to any Loan Document."</data>
