<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A commitment by a lender to provide a certain amount of financing to a borrower at specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agreements by the Lender to provide certain amounts to the Borrower under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the obligations undertaken by the Lenders to provide funding to the Borrowers under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments relate to the agreements that Lenders make to provide funding and financial support to Participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the obligations of the parties to lend and borrow as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.01 outlines the commitments described in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments are mentioned as being related to the Loans and the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments of each Lender are stated in relation to the Loans owed to them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The agreed-upon commitments that are relevant to the Guaranty and associated obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The commitments referred to in the Guaranty must be terminated after all obligations have been met."&lt;SEP&gt;"declare the Commitment of each Lender to be terminated, whereupon the Commitments shall be terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"no Borrower is using 'plan assets'... in connection with the Loans or the Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"represents the total amount of funds that lenders are willing to lend under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a31c36ed901a72ca5ab4680118396c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3d28f90b238b652e176c2dd580a5570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf4af83bed6de952eac63d1c88a41b05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30653a5374e65a8632e95b754c57b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d54ee29a5862af1d18ce227e29cd2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47b63c04161f585f94497b117b3c2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a96bacab82b00d7072260f42bfacea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f3ce5eef87d6ccefcbefcd4c22f900c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebc127d2ee310e0ffab541e513e3c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b66bb0e69b3312fb4cf7d1ea88401235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e512310577a496a30e98195826f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8dee29c21b9e13109325207e08d34c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e80366860c95b25b6d0f01880d9bab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
