<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 'Benchmark Replacement Date' is when the transition to a new benchmark rate takes effect following a transition event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement Date is the specific date on which the benchmark replacement is established."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which a replacement for the then-current Benchmark is identified and put into effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when a new benchmark rate replaces the Term SOFR Reference Rate if it is not published."&lt;SEP&gt;"The earliest date related to the occurrence of the Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"a specific date relating to the adjustment or replacement of a benchmark rate, such as when SOFR is not published."&lt;SEP&gt;"the applicable Benchmark Replacement Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-114048bd63b08e08234db8c9890cd85e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd223e171341ca9ee826596f361fff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a76f71d1b6b261f7a5c4a8452b4b8b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c2f465958aa8d827747f82da9775636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87a8ff9ff8a250dc33e72d58dd5f0185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac3eabdef973ef98caa3f06b7973c3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbaf061a5d10dddff589ed1a422c891</data>
