<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender shall, by notice to the Administrative Agent not later than the date that is 20 days after the date of the Company's notice requesting an extension of the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders on the Maturity Date the aggregate principal amount of Loans made to such Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which a loan becomes due and payable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when the loan amount becomes due and payable under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The earliest of the Maturity Date and the date of termination of the Aggregate Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first anniversary of the Maturity Date then in effect (the Existing Maturity Date)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unless previously terminated, the Aggregate Commitments shall automatically terminate at 5:00 p.m., New York City time, on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"no Interest Period shall extend beyond the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"“Maturity Date” means the later of (a) November 1, 2028... if such date is not a Business Day, the Maturity Date shall be the immediately preceding Business Day."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ffe20bb927a839907621def342fe8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b637d0405cd4cb720fa5cc51c6eae36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-682c5ead894d7b0b1048fdd5c656db16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65b1b045a2cc5774bf77945831da1f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fb04e696f0e29f406fbbcbc3c61988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69954b308816d8f15f00d6a218095eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8dee29c21b9e13109325207e08d34c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03af5f04d160195f41c432f35a87dba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16bb085b27b215635aa84c84b806bd3</data>
