<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate for Loans denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"A benchmark rate used in the context of the RFR Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR represents a simple average of the secured overnight financing rate calculated daily."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR, the Daily Simple SONIA or the Daily Simple SARON, as applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"The benchmark rate applicable to the Loans as affected by various clauses."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, for any day with respect to any Loan denominated in US Dollars, an interest rate per annum equal to the greater of SOFR for the day..."&lt;SEP&gt;"shall bear interest at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Simple SOFR plus the Applicable Rate"&lt;SEP&gt;"so long as the Daily Simple SOFR is not the subject of a Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Daily Simple SOFR as a benchmark replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Daily Simple SOFR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-136369fb607ffcc8874842ebfb8e0494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a5ad517c90fcfe773feaed3aa6ca69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a76f71d1b6b261f7a5c4a8452b4b8b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87a8ff9ff8a250dc33e72d58dd5f0185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8d92840a114cf25e84b01ae67d626e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30c831ae2ececd9089c39cf051b149e</data>
