  <data key="d1">"An entity receiving funds or obligations under a contract, often requiring compliance with specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity that receives payments under the specified financial agreements, subject to tax implications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Recipient receives payments for Indemnified Taxes and other liabilities from Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"If any Recipient determines, in its sole discretion exercised in good faith, that it has received a refund of any Taxes as to which it has been indemnified by any Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Recipient refers to any person subject to Other Connection Taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"the applicable Recipient receives an amount equal to the sum it would have received had no such withholding or deduction been made."</data>
