<node id="&quot;AUD BANK BILL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'ABBR Loan' means a Loan that bears interest at a rate based on the AUD Bank Bill Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUD Bank Bill Rate is referenced with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Australian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUD Bank Bill Rate is the interest rate for short-term loans in the Australian dollar market."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Australian benchmark interest rate mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"CDO Rate or the AUD Bank Bill Rate for the applicable Agreed Currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Relation to the calculation or computation of the AUD Bank Bill Rate, such day shall also be a day on which banks are open for business in Sydney."&lt;SEP&gt;"if such Benchmark is the AUD Bank Bill Rate, 11:00 a.m., Sydney time, on the first date of such setting."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, with respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Australian Dollars for any Interest Period, the AUD Screen Rate at approximately 11:00 a.m., Sydney time, on the first day of such Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"shall bear interest at a rate per annum equal to the AUD Bank Bill Rate for such Interest Period plus the Applicable Rate"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-136369fb607ffcc8874842ebfb8e0494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a5ad517c90fcfe773feaed3aa6ca69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eefedf253aa5dbf448ba73486c0c9393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26824d3e5b8a3855832d86ede39df399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76721ac2a3b4759d7a2bf2bc4ad4ef87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3480d75b314bdfade2362555e7d58a0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab70c1cf5fa53da3db1e0969d425127&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e63704c823f60ff60db1c6d5c81360</data>
