<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "AGREEMENT" refers to a formal document that establishes the terms, obligations, and conditions agreed upon by the parties involved in the lending and borrowing process. This comprehensive Agreement outlines the rights and responsibilities of Lenders and Borrowers, detailing the framework under which loans and commitments are structured, including aspects such as interest rates and tax compliance.

The Agreement encompasses various Loan Documents, including specific provisions related to indemnification payments and stipulations for any amendments or waivers. Each Lender is bound to the Agreement, which designates their obligations, including the authorization for the Administrative Agent to apply funds under certain conditions. Furthermore, parties may pledge or assign their rights within the Agreement, and it clarifies how any claims or disputes will be governed by the laws of the State of New York.

The content of the Agreement indicates that it must be duly executed by all parties, including the Borrowers, to become effective. It emphasizes that the execution and delivery of the Agreement do not waive any existing defaults and includes provisions for conditions precedent required for the initial Loan. This document is structured to ensure clarity and legal compliance, facilitating the administration of the Loans and the management of relationships among all parties involved, including any changes affecting capital or the responsibilities of the Administrative Agent.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e27d526ebea615c4be84a55d4f0b816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb67ffcaf5d2d9cf2ad7c51a9e64eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b55e21aa490b434d07102ac0a0f431fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0264408b13fa227639776ebb2dea19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3418942ce8e1361510ccfc2198b1fa32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca8b0468db8545a24275a4dfce981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb5948dc7921697af24df64c845c94cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04941ed205923b18f0bf4880505546aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ff0231dce6b36c6d76b94f8cf52da74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3d68df312f7f16c4d8e4af5e1d769f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64b92c3143192c5d21c6bc4366d17ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222ae97c7f771b1a3946c9792829f5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decc7f4374f137eff5fab6d32d23ffb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c12e211d90e41dfed2685959712c895&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5e7a44196120f6da0565ee30ce4f44c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a31c36ed901a72ca5ab4680118396c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89f964103597bcd628827c468cbe37fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908e057abb31aea6181bbab412901e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2878cd0c0d66978fe2fad240129e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c914ecc1ba4cc04797717a927d91fd0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b7e5fb7ef25d62c32b6776f5ce5ec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd134db0bc206ab3f3f82b20bcb3e960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40c9da145f3e45db09eb70b219243579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54326f4acdff2aa7b9cbed3bcfd85041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d9c5f65cb063bd579f780b899db70de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ffc10305b0d82a3d7fc2912b8eedd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6ea716059b2dcd9fb31d7b464c8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03af5f04d160195f41c432f35a87dba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b38bf4d494cdd0bad5a59de9d747b89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b47f6528050492ac38aa96576c8e318f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e80366860c95b25b6d0f01880d9bab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">The entity "LOAN" refers to a financial agreement in which a lender provides a sum of money, often with interest, to a borrower under specific terms and conditions. Loans can be categorized into various types, including Base Rate Loans, and they can be requested in different currencies, such as US Dollars or alternative currencies. The process involves the borrower agreeing to repay the borrowed amount, typically inclusive of interest, according to the stipulations outlined in the mutual contract. Each loan extends the representation and warranty regarding the specified conditions of the agreement, including an interest rate determined by the administrative authority, which is considered conclusive and binding unless obvious errors are identified.

In these financial arrangements, the total outstanding amount of all loans at any given time is referred to as "Total Outstandings." Furthermore, proceeds from each loan should ideally be used to refinance existing borrowings as per the existing credit agreements. Interest on the loans is due and payable in arrears on scheduled payment dates, and other specific terms may apply depending on whether the loan is denominated in alternative currencies, which carry their unique stipulations regarding interest periods. Overall, "LOAN" encapsulates a structured financial transaction aimed at facilitating borrowing and lending, governed by regulatory agreements and terms mutually agreed upon by lenders and borrowers.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8e27d526ebea615c4be84a55d4f0b816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a26a8f2185f90f4a7c53bd3079e8fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fc70f558d9d3be9de8c361ce71acf2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f0bafe42f00dd1c76df46673dbc679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbdf531655886df91c6a944df9d3f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34eaba7aa393831d52ae42e0a132d620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d204affd1db47ef8495cc75bef03d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dda991dc457e11db2c6f0fe242fa41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46b17dc38cedefc3b1d4ee3fb0408407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29f4c749687effde35d0fcb513406dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edbaf061a5d10dddff589ed1a422c891&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20befec6f4f86230799a586873e29458&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4618ecc33dccdd0d44eedddbd072848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51a7fc07faff35fcf2b53abfe1e576bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30c831ae2ececd9089c39cf051b149e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"BUSINESS DAY" refers to a specific type of day in which financial institutions are open for operations and can process transactions related to various financial activities, particularly loans. A Business Day is defined as any day that is not a holiday or weekend, specifically excluding Saturdays and Sundays, as well as any day on which banks in the relevant jurisdiction are permitted or required to remain closed. This definition is crucial for determining the timing of financial transactions, interest periods, and exchanges, including those referenced in contexts such as the SONIA (Sterling Overnight Interbank Average Rate) and SARON (Swiss Average Rate Overnight).

Business Days are essential for the calculation of interest and fees on loans, with payments made by borrowers typically reflected in these calculations on the following Business Day. In instances where a day isn't classified as a Business Day, any obligations or timelines are extended to the next succeeding Business Day; conversely, if a required action falls on a non-Business Day, it reverts to the immediately preceding Business Day.

Overall, a Business Day represents a standard working day recognized by banking institutions for conducting a range of business transactions, with specific implications and definitions varying slightly depending on the context of use, such as federal funds rate publication or agreements made between financial parties.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-55b2896fc19ee92000ef6c8ffa2b237a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5839c8b0001ef46cee7014785f70db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe20bb927a839907621def342fe8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114048bd63b08e08234db8c9890cd85e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a26a8f2185f90f4a7c53bd3079e8fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19647c660eda6fb81aa633a58a5f4db8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e7dcabb468b7608dfc9bd9ddc9d5a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34eaba7aa393831d52ae42e0a132d620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6867baaac8b80330e888c5f64e303ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46b17dc38cedefc3b1d4ee3fb0408407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d7e61b5ba03e84e04debff056fcb68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69954b308816d8f15f00d6a218095eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1b524689b64150f0e90d892977bb5ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6ea716059b2dcd9fb31d7b464c8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb5948dc7921697af24df64c845c94cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f5ad49f8201d6b0a3fcd9f24a173bff</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Required Lenders" refers to a specific group of lenders that hold significant influence and authority in the context of loan agreements and financial decision-making. Required Lenders are defined as those whose Total Credit Exposures exceed 50% of the total credit exposure held by all lenders. Their consent is essential for various critical decisions, including amendments to loan terms, waiver of borrower obligations, and actions associated with Term Benchmark Loans during an Event of Default.

Required Lenders play a pivotal role in extending the Maturity Date of loans before the anniversary of the Closing Date and are necessary for agreeing on the Benchmark Replacement. They possess the authority to appoint a successor agent in the event of the resignation of the Administrative Agent, and they can dictate actions that the Administrative Agent may take, demonstrating their significant influence in the decision-making processes. 

Additionally, any amendments to the definition of 'Default Rate' or other contractual obligations require the consent of the Required Lenders. They are also vested with rights typically attributed to the Administrative Agent as specified in the loan agreement. In circumstances where they object to proposed changes, a written notice from the Required Lenders must be issued, indicating their dissent regarding amendments. Their involvement is crucial for maintaining the integrity of the lender agreement and ensuring that major actions align with the financial interests of those lenders that represent a majority of the lending landscape.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eefedf253aa5dbf448ba73486c0c9393&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e7dcabb468b7608dfc9bd9ddc9d5a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30653a5374e65a8632e95b754c57b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d9c5f65cb063bd579f780b899db70de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb201d631d7848d67d10aae35e099b65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54326f4acdff2aa7b9cbed3bcfd85041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cabe83ce9a5578a5842967d84102a5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fb04e696f0e29f406fbbcbc3c61988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222ae97c7f771b1a3946c9792829f5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b38bf4d494cdd0bad5a59de9d747b89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7720be909cc189d41144f4a242562dee</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">A "Defaulting Lender" is defined as a lender that has failed to fulfill its obligations under the loan agreement, which includes not making required payments or complying with the terms outlined in the agreements. This failure impacts the actions of the Administrative Agent regarding the Loan Documents and may lead to the Defaulting Lender being subject to removal by the Required Lenders in accordance with applicable law. 

The term encompasses lenders that are in default under the agreements, which affects their obligations. A Defaulting Lender may also face certain restrictions on assignment, and any assignment made by such a lender does not waive or release any claims related to their status as a Defaulting Lender. Furthermore, if a lender is categorized as a Defaulting Lender, they will lose the right to approve or disapprove any amendments, waivers, or consents associated with the loan arrangement. 

It is important to note that a Defaulting Lender is characterized by their failure to fund required loans or make necessary payments, and this status can influence the proceedings or notifications they may be involved in. However, there is the possibility for a lender to cease being classified as a Defaulting Lender, although retroactive adjustments regarding accrued commitment fees or payments made while under this status are not permitted. Additionally, the term includes any entity that has breached its obligations under the loan agreement, indicating the serious implications of defaulting in a lending scenario.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a31c36ed901a72ca5ab4680118396c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e7dcabb468b7608dfc9bd9ddc9d5a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54326f4acdff2aa7b9cbed3bcfd85041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d204affd1db47ef8495cc75bef03d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47b63c04161f585f94497b117b3c2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dda991dc457e11db2c6f0fe242fa41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cabe83ce9a5578a5842967d84102a5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fcc72ff1504036d164ec1d50008421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b7e5fb7ef25d62c32b6776f5ce5ec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402c64da04ddc5608cee1856dcbb9a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3d82811c7780b4302319f3c32c1d99</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">In the context of the provided descriptions, the term "Person" encompasses any individual or legal entity engaged in lending transactions and activities defined in the relevant Agreement and Loan Documents. The term is not limited to natural persons; it includes any entity recognized under law, whether engaged in borrowing or lending activities, and can refer to individuals or entities responsible for repayment obligations. 

"Person" generally refers to those involved in legal transactions and obligations related to indebtedness, which can include a Lender, a borrower, or other parties affected by these transactions. This definition extends to parties listed in legal or financial documents, allowing for a broad interpretation that incorporates various roles within lending agreements, including those acting in capacities such as Administrative Agents.

The descriptions further clarify that "Person" can refer to parties who may receive assignments, those with specific obligations under the defined Indebtedness, and individuals or entities that are subject to certain restrictions as outlined in the Agreement. It also acknowledges related parties, including affiliates, partners, directors, and employees associated with any Person.

Moreover, "Person" can include legal entities such as partnerships, corporations, and trusts, emphasizing a collective understanding that encompasses a wide array of entities that participate in transactions discussed within the documents, whether they be liable under obligations or simply referenced for notices or other payment agreements. Lastly, the term is inclusive of successors and permitted assigns of any defined Person in the context of these legal frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f60fe652862a5fef1cb2975c9c32d329&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e27d526ebea615c4be84a55d4f0b816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6482914c0025ca6e6f96599e51f700a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb67ffcaf5d2d9cf2ad7c51a9e64eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a27f77c73892a85827ba609cc034cc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ed9aefdad35a1c17af0afe893bb8783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e512310577a496a30e98195826f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e63704c823f60ff60db1c6d5c81360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca8b0468db8545a24275a4dfce981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa8c3d4e7bd2cf291921773f12fdecb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c29a34e8bd32ad19590a2a476291a988&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e819e916670c9c95b31c4bd2754163b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffe20bb927a839907621def342fe8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f0bafe42f00dd1c76df46673dbc679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cabe83ce9a5578a5842967d84102a5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d90f9159b8174053b0f23f53399fd87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3480d75b314bdfade2362555e7d58a0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29f4c749687effde35d0fcb513406dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3d82811c7780b4302319f3c32c1d99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5839c8b0001ef46cee7014785f70db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656cbd22be80eec811fc0e6c4285e66b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799d87a5e4756281156056acd9a964ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86a884885df7dabe845b456af1d2e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2812a7eb1995b6a4da755313fb50a5a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d54ee29a5862af1d18ce227e29cd2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac3eabdef973ef98caa3f06b7973c3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e1fe6dedd3de03de6a01be405d8196f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8d27f894ac5b5a4ee00299e5748e845</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Lenders" are defined as financial entities or institutions that provide loans to the Company and individuals, participating in the financial transactions governed by specific loan documents and agreements. Each Borrower is obligated to repay the Lenders on the Maturity Date the aggregate principal amount of the loans that remain outstanding. The Lenders are entitled to receive various payments, including fees, charges, and reasonable disbursements associated with the loans extended to the Borrowers.

The Lenders work under the guidance of an Administrative Agent, who is responsible for notifying them about important actions, such as interest rates applicable to Term Benchmark Loans and borrowing requests. They are also required to consent before certain loans can be requested and must be duly notified of any termination or reduction of Aggregate Commitments. The Lenders may include both individual and institutional investors, and they are categorized as Credit Parties under the agreement.

Under the terms of the Agreement, the Lenders engage in a broad range of transactions that might involve differing interests from those of the Company and the Borrowers. Each Lender must approve amendments, waivers, or consents, which do not extend or increase their individual commitments without consent. The Required Lenders have additional powers, such as appointing a successor agent with the Company's written consent. Furthermore, the Company must provide financial statements and other essential documents to both the Administrative Agent and the Lenders as stipulated in the Agreement. Collectively, the Lenders play a crucial role in offering financing and are responsible for various administrative and operational tasks related to the loans and commitments.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf4af83bed6de952eac63d1c88a41b05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d76442dc7c26385612da21161d48e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65b1b045a2cc5774bf77945831da1f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0264408b13fa227639776ebb2dea19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72e9f7fa7f94e8348291ef7c5f0bdef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd320686a1f984b7fbe703eddfa1995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cabe83ce9a5578a5842967d84102a5d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69954b308816d8f15f00d6a218095eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222ae97c7f771b1a3946c9792829f5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1de73b3018151cf03fd33ccbe0fd5885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b637d0405cd4cb720fa5cc51c6eae36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30653a5374e65a8632e95b754c57b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fcc72ff1504036d164ec1d50008421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013593d672f130ddc9fe444ebd690c2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170b99e108ab1f8946426f5753c65c25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60b528159be4d1e030e14d2840fd1dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8b8425899884f5c78c8851e6e77ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54326f4acdff2aa7b9cbed3bcfd85041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d9c5f65cb063bd579f780b899db70de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec07a1eab7686ab6eef9aa9d7515a3e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e137338a832bcfa1152a34534e03e73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8890e5da0c89b8e12882c5f4bdf02be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b38bf4d494cdd0bad5a59de9d747b89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6867baaac8b80330e888c5f64e303ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e80366860c95b25b6d0f01880d9bab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">LOANS refer to financial transactions in which money is borrowed by a Borrower from a Lender, with the expectation of repayment along with interest as stipulated in a loan agreement. These financial instruments encompass various amounts of money provided by Lenders, which must be repaid according to the terms outlined in the Loan Documents. They are typically associated with interest rates and specific repayment schedules and can be denominated in different currencies, including US Dollars and Alternative Currencies. 

Each Borrower is obligated to repay the aggregate principal of the Loans outstanding on the Maturity Date, which signifies the end of the loan term. In scenarios involving Alternative Currencies, Borrowers can prepay Loans in amounts sufficient to reduce the Outstanding Amount. These Loans can be categorized based on their type and currency, and each portion is treated as a separate Borrowing. Furthermore, financial obligations under which Participants and Lenders operate may involve Loan commitments that have to be satisfied with certain conditions that are not collectively binding among the Lenders.

Loans also represent financial resources that Borrowers can request through designated procedures, and the commitments and principal amounts owed to each Lender may change over time according to the agreement's terms. The process of borrowing is facilitated by participation agreements, allowing for the purchase of interests in Loans for cash at face value. Overall, Loans are essential financial products characterized by clearly defined terms of borrowing and repayment, integral to the functioning of both Lenders and Borrowers in a financial context.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8bd69db9f06963e7195b77c581e5be64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf4af83bed6de952eac63d1c88a41b05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65b1b045a2cc5774bf77945831da1f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e512310577a496a30e98195826f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8dee29c21b9e13109325207e08d34c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca8b0468db8545a24275a4dfce981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ff0231dce6b36c6d76b94f8cf52da74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47b63c04161f585f94497b117b3c2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4fe896846cd167076f22c0725da64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decc7f4374f137eff5fab6d32d23ffb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3d82811c7780b4302319f3c32c1d99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b2896fc19ee92000ef6c8ffa2b237a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b637d0405cd4cb720fa5cc51c6eae36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a31c36ed901a72ca5ab4680118396c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89f964103597bcd628827c468cbe37fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23aa4dfdccf3a6a169a3556f56d5601f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d7e61b5ba03e84e04debff056fcb68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fcc72ff1504036d164ec1d50008421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10aab01983c7602494d5f25b52cc07d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8d92840a114cf25e84b01ae67d626e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86a884885df7dabe845b456af1d2e81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d54ee29a5862af1d18ce227e29cd2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec07a1eab7686ab6eef9aa9d7515a3e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a96bacab82b00d7072260f42bfacea5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e137338a832bcfa1152a34534e03e73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f49c592b729adb7e15c622ae94fd2ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b66bb0e69b3312fb4cf7d1ea88401235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6ea716059b2dcd9fb31d7b464c8ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03af5f04d160195f41c432f35a87dba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e80366860c95b25b6d0f01880d9bab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "LOAN DOCUMENTS" refer to a comprehensive set of legal agreements and documents related to the procurement and management of loans between the involved parties, including the Company, Borrowers, and Lenders. These documents govern the terms and compliance requirements associated with the lending process, outlining the specific obligations and expectations of each party.

The Loan Documents encompass a variety of legal instruments, such as notes, guarantees, and agreements that establish the terms and conditions of the loan. They set forth the operational guidelines related to the Benchmark Replacement and stipulate the duties and responsibilities of the parties involved. Each Borrower is required to have the requisite power and authority to execute and perform their obligations under the Loan Documents to which they are a party.

Furthermore, each Lender is responsible for maintaining a register that records the details of each Participant’s interest in the Loans or other obligations under these documents. The Loan Documents also specify that the functions of the Administrative Agent are limited to the duties expressly stated within the agreements.

Overall, the Loan Documents form the legal framework governing the financial transactions and ensure that all parties adhere to the established terms and conditions throughout the life of the loan. They include the primary Agreement, Notes, Designated Borrower Requests, and any related documents necessary for the administration, modification, or waiver of the provisions contained therein.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-114048bd63b08e08234db8c9890cd85e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf4af83bed6de952eac63d1c88a41b05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f21272229c5dd2ca4ee5799336e5131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb201d631d7848d67d10aae35e099b65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca8b0468db8545a24275a4dfce981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d019c3df8aed44c5ff8ea4da836ddf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd320686a1f984b7fbe703eddfa1995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26824d3e5b8a3855832d86ede39df399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29f4c749687effde35d0fcb513406dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908e057abb31aea6181bbab412901e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b7e5fb7ef25d62c32b6776f5ce5ec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170b99e108ab1f8946426f5753c65c25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60b528159be4d1e030e14d2840fd1dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd134db0bc206ab3f3f82b20bcb3e960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbd223e171341ca9ee826596f361fff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8d54ee29a5862af1d18ce227e29cd2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ffc10305b0d82a3d7fc2912b8eedd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8890e5da0c89b8e12882c5f4bdf02be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6867baaac8b80330e888c5f64e303ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e80366860c95b25b6d0f01880d9bab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
  <data key="d4">citibank-amazon</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Borrower" is defined as an individual or entity that receives funds from a lender under the terms of a loan agreement and is obligated to repay the funds according to specified terms. As the recipient of the loan, the Borrower is accountable for adhering to the conditions outlined in the agreement, including repayment schedules and any related obligations. 

The Borrower may have the option to request loans in currencies other than US Dollars and is allowed to voluntarily prepay any borrowing in whole or part, provided they notify the Administrative Agent. Moreover, the Borrower acknowledges that they cannot use "plan assets" related to any loans or commitments, and they are responsible for ensuring compliance with all terms set forth in the loan documents.

In terms of legal obligations, should a Borrower experience a Material Adverse Effect due to an ERISA Event, they are liable under the agreement. Each Borrower must represent and warrant their proper organization or formation as well as the authority to enter into loan documents. Additionally, the Borrower consents to the loan arrangements and must approve any extensions of credit.

The governing laws of the agreement delineate the rights and responsibilities of the Borrower, including the repayment of principal amounts due to lenders on the Maturity Date. The Borrower is also required to execute and deliver any necessary notes to lenders as requested. Furthermore, the Borrower agrees that any liabilities arising from information use waives any claims related to such uses.

In summary, the Borrower is a key party in the lending arrangement, tasked with the reception and timely repayment of funds, while also maintaining obligations related to the terms of the loan agreement.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-136369fb607ffcc8874842ebfb8e0494&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bd69db9f06963e7195b77c581e5be64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f21272229c5dd2ca4ee5799336e5131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76721ac2a3b4759d7a2bf2bc4ad4ef87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46b17dc38cedefc3b1d4ee3fb0408407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d76442dc7c26385612da21161d48e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d65b1b045a2cc5774bf77945831da1f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a27f77c73892a85827ba609cc034cc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787299885ac70dd86e4f90a80cc13d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b55e21aa490b434d07102ac0a0f431fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e512310577a496a30e98195826f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd240b40422f73cdf615b12afee971f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0c6db4a22086f6817a75820f943bae7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d019c3df8aed44c5ff8ea4da836ddf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04941ed205923b18f0bf4880505546aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f0bafe42f00dd1c76df46673dbc679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f1e764a2d3e36453f112d7fa49a7bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e7dcabb468b7608dfc9bd9ddc9d5a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3480d75b314bdfade2362555e7d58a0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4fe896846cd167076f22c0725da64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69954b308816d8f15f00d6a218095eef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9200500d9e9bba8db3c46d21566903a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decc7f4374f137eff5fab6d32d23ffb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1de73b3018151cf03fd33ccbe0fd5885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452c2953347bc2f086e4d6b4155670f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5e7a44196120f6da0565ee30ce4f44c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16bb085b27b215635aa84c84b806bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b2896fc19ee92000ef6c8ffa2b237a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5839c8b0001ef46cee7014785f70db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3d82811c7780b4302319f3c32c1d99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656cbd22be80eec811fc0e6c4285e66b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a31c36ed901a72ca5ab4680118396c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e073682a2255e59c1511911cc15ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23aa4dfdccf3a6a169a3556f56d5601f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e30653a5374e65a8632e95b754c57b27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908e057abb31aea6181bbab412901e6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47d7e61b5ba03e84e04debff056fcb68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10aab01983c7602494d5f25b52cc07d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4618ecc33dccdd0d44eedddbd072848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed8d92840a114cf25e84b01ae67d626e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a5ad517c90fcfe773feaed3aa6ca69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93b54c15e90f05e8c79326d1545bc72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fc70f558d9d3be9de8c361ce71acf2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b08b3f3072ce727419bf04e8f76f991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd134db0bc206ab3f3f82b20bcb3e960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec07a1eab7686ab6eef9aa9d7515a3e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35ffc10305b0d82a3d7fc2912b8eedd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f49c592b729adb7e15c622ae94fd2ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b66bb0e69b3312fb4cf7d1ea88401235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03af5f04d160195f41c432f35a87dba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b47f6528050492ac38aa96576c8e318f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8d27f894ac5b5a4ee00299e5748e845&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c30c831ae2ececd9089c39cf051b149e</data>
