<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Designated Borrower" refers to specific borrowers identified in the context of financial agreements. A Designated Borrower is recognized as an applicant borrower when formally specified within the agreement. It may include foreign subsidiaries, which have unique considerations such as immunity from jurisdiction over their assets. 

In financing agreements, the Designated Borrower can signify an entity that meets certain characteristics or criteria established within the contract. This designation is essential as it pertains to entities that have liabilities or obligations under a Guaranty that the Company guarantees, as well as to those approved by the Administrative Agent for particular borrowing purposes.

Each Designated Borrower is responsible for fulfilling payment obligations to the Lender and may incur additional costs for which they must also provide compensation. Additionally, a Designated Borrower's status is contingent upon there being no outstanding loans to them, and they must confirm their financial condition, business operations, and any relevant guarantors as required by the Company.

Furthermore, the inclusion of any additional subsidiary as a Designated Borrower is subject to the approval of the Lenders involved. The designation is specified further in the agreement, particularly in Section 2.14, establishing the framework of responsibilities and the conditions under which the borrowing takes place. Overall, the Designated Borrower plays a crucial role within the financial structure of the agreement, embodying the obligations and responsibilities appropriate to the context in which it is defined.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9f83e417a5add163ad10e4377d0ce348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72e9f7fa7f94e8348291ef7c5f0bdef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3418942ce8e1361510ccfc2198b1fa32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac30e62676e9dd8464466d3b50e740a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26824d3e5b8a3855832d86ede39df399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64b92c3143192c5d21c6bc4366d17ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1de73b3018151cf03fd33ccbe0fd5885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7720be909cc189d41144f4a242562dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16bb085b27b215635aa84c84b806bd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-656cbd22be80eec811fc0e6c4285e66b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1a459200732a5fd30dd047486081e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2878cd0c0d66978fe2fad240129e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fcc72ff1504036d164ec1d50008421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10aab01983c7602494d5f25b52cc07d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a5ad517c90fcfe773feaed3aa6ca69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3d28f90b238b652e176c2dd580a5570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d9c5f65cb063bd579f780b899db70de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebc127d2ee310e0ffab541e513e3c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e137338a832bcfa1152a34534e03e73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8d27f894ac5b5a4ee00299e5748e845</data>
