<node id="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Company" refers to a legal entity that engages in business activities, enters into contracts, and is responsible for its own liabilities. It plays a critical role in various financial transactions, specifically in the context of agreements with lenders related to loan and borrowing practices. The Company is involved in commercial lending and operates through structured Loan Documents, making it the primary obligor in the agreements under the terms outlined.

Regarding its obligations, the Company may incur liabilities under the Employee Retirement Income Security Act (ERISA) and has authority concerning pension plans for employees. It also must maintain policies to ensure compliance with regulations and is referenced in various contexts across agreements, including Guarantee Obligations where it acts as a guarantor. The Company’s financial condition is presented consistently with Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP), and it is responsible for ensuring accurate reporting of its Subsidiaries’ financial results.

The Company interacts with Lenders and the Administrative Agent in numerous ways, including the notification of interest rates applicable to loan agreements, managing funding obligations, and ensuring that all necessary notices and communications are delivered in accordance with the agreement. It is further responsible for safeguarding its interests and can replace Lenders or designate Borrowers under specific conditions outlined in the agreement, thus maintaining a flexible approach to its financial obligations.

Additionally, the Company must handle all reasonable and documented expenses incurred by the Administrative Agent and its Affiliates and pay additional amounts to compensate Lenders for costs resulting from the Company’s obligations. Any defaults in payment or substantial liabilities may affect both the Company and its Subsidiaries, underscoring the importance of maintaining compliance and fulfilling financial commitments.

In summary, the Company functions as a structured financial entity engaged in lending activities, responsible for its operational and compliance requirements within the framework of</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f60fe652862a5fef1cb2975c9c32d329&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb201d631d7848d67d10aae35e099b65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dda991dc457e11db2c6f0fe242fa41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94a1007905a86e506e6e4f88af978a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787299885ac70dd86e4f90a80cc13d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72e9f7fa7f94e8348291ef7c5f0bdef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71e63704c823f60ff60db1c6d5c81360&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65ca8b0468db8545a24275a4dfce981f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47b63c04161f585f94497b117b3c2ede&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3220202f279a00dc3005f2c4e6d628ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222ae97c7f771b1a3946c9792829f5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd556ce2d17fee516c55b192e70ba8b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452c2953347bc2f086e4d6b4155670f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b637d0405cd4cb720fa5cc51c6eae36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d624f61bb767a4545277bbfbfc1c2aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34eaba7aa393831d52ae42e0a132d620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf8265680b576d949a33956718f4bea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3d28f90b238b652e176c2dd580a5570&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8b8425899884f5c78c8851e6e77ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebc127d2ee310e0ffab541e513e3c00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b66bb0e69b3312fb4cf7d1ea88401235&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402c64da04ddc5608cee1856dcbb9a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f778cd58ca4cfdb5bd37891a04aa6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-114048bd63b08e08234db8c9890cd85e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-231a0d0a9307dfd95b4523972c93623b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1eb67ffcaf5d2d9cf2ad7c51a9e64eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73f1653519cb5388ba4815ea4c08f2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d84235c02ed2cf616010c0ffce2449b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e819e916670c9c95b31c4bd2754163b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd320686a1f984b7fbe703eddfa1995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f0bafe42f00dd1c76df46673dbc679&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8282e1ae265a3d7d81c2a8812fb723aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ff0231dce6b36c6d76b94f8cf52da74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8afd4f755e720f4d83553494467fe767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7267b52937bd4a1c6