<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">54.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"All references herein to a 'Subsidiary' shall refer to a Subsidiary or Subsidiaries of the Company."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary is linked to the Company in terms of obligations and activities detailed in the Agreement."}&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries of the Company must not cease to be a Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiary is a corporation owned or controlled by the Company, indicating a corporate relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company and Subsidiary are connected through their ordinary conduct of business, as Subsidiaries are typically owned by a parent company, in this case, the Company."|&gt;"Ownership/Incorporation"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is connected to its Subsidiaries in terms of shared information and business activities."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company often has a Subsidiary that may incur liabilities or assets during financial arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiary is controlled by the Company, indicating a parent-subsidiary relationship."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">"Corporate Structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiary Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"control relationship"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"corporate structure"&lt;SEP&gt;5&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;link to control and ownership&gt;&gt;</data>
