  <data key="d5">25.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"The Agreement establishes the framework within which the Company operates and its responsibilities regarding assignments and waivers.""&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company has specific provisions regarding its obligations and exemptions under the Agreement related to indemnification payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is a party to the Agreement, indicating participation in the Loan Documents framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is bound by the terms in the Agreement, including requests for extensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is involved in the agreement as the designated agent to receive legal processes, establishing their role in the agreement."</data>
