  <data key="d5">66.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"Any Lender becomes a Defaulting Lender as stated in this Agreement."."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender may at any time pledge or assign a security interest in all or any portion of its rights under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender acknowledges receipt of the Agreement which outlines their responsibilities and commitments."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement outlines the framework under which a Lender can assign its rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement outlines the terms between the Lender and the Borrower regarding disbursement and repayment."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has obligations outlined in the Agreement related to indemnification and tax compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender relies on the representations and warranties of the Agreement and Loan Documents."."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship exists in the context of the Agreement underwriting the interactions between Lender and Borrower."."&lt;SEP&gt;"the administration of this Agreement involves rights and obligations related to Lenders who partake in transactions and related expenses."}</data>
