  <data key="d5">37.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"Assignments cannot be made to the Company or any Borrowers as per the restrictions outlined in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has obligations towards the Company in the context of a financial agreement and cannot exceed certain limits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to approve the extension proposed by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company acts as a Borrower under the Loan Documents and is subject to the terms of the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company acts as a party among the Borrowers in the agreements."|&gt;"involvement"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is responsible for providing notices and communications to the Borrower as specified in Schedule 11.02."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is the borrower that receives funds under the loan agreement from the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may act as a Borrower in obtaining funds as outlined in the financial agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must provide financial compliance documents to the Borrower as part of the Loan Documents."</data>
