<edge source="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d5">13.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"The Designated Borrower is tied to the obligations that the Company assumes under the Guaranty."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations of each Designated Borrower are guaranteed by the Company."</data>
