<edge source="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d5">48.0</data>
  <data key="d6">"Any notice delivered to the Company is also deemed delivered to each Designated Borrower."\&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company can designate additional Subsidiaries as Designated Borrowers to receive loans from Lenders."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company guarantees the Obligations of each Designated Borrower pursuant to the Guaranty contained in Article X."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company will cause the Designated Borrower to compensate the Lender for incurred losses, indicating their interconnectedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company will ensure that the Designated Borrower pays the compensation due to the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company's obligations are linked to those of the Designated Borrower, as it provides guarantees for the borrower's liabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated borrower appoints the Company as its agent to receive service of process, indicating a direct relationship where the Company acts on behalf of the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Company requires the financial condition, business and operations of such Designated Borrower and any such other guarantor."|&gt;"Company Requirement"</data>
  <data key="d7">"8"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency"&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantee"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;"lending relationship"</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-5d58db72e1791e0d73773cc0befded1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d9c5f65cb063bd579f780b899db70de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1a459200732a5fd30dd047486081e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f2878cd0c0d66978fe2fad240129e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28fcc72ff1504036d164ec1d50008421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e137338a832bcfa1152a34534e03e73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72e9f7fa7f94e8348291ef7c5f0bdef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3418942ce8e1361510ccfc2198b1fa32</data>
