<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d5">150.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT and the COMPANY is characterized by a structured framework of responsibilities and obligations, primarily centered around the management and oversight of loan agreements. The ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT plays a vital role in monitoring the COMPANY’s compliance with its obligations under the Loan Documents. This oversight includes notifying the COMPANY of any significant decisions made by the Required Lenders, managing benchmark changes that affect the COMPANY’s agreements, and informing the COMPANY about applicable interest rates for loans.

Furthermore, the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT has a fiduciary relationship with the COMPANY, which entails representing the interests of the lenders while also coordinating with the COMPANY regarding loan management. Notably, the interests of the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT may diverge from those of the COMPANY, suggesting a complex relationship that involves oversight and engagement.

To facilitate their working relationship, the COMPANY communicates essential information to the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT concerning actions such as the termination or reduction of Aggregate Commitments and occurrences of Defaults. Additionally, the COMPANY is responsible for delivering various documents, including a certificate prior to the Extension Closing Date, and must also provide consent for assignments managed by the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT.

The COMPANY is obligated to pay the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT and any sub-agents for their services and is required to cover expenses incurred by the ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT in the course of their duties. Communication between the two entities is further formalized through notifications regarding funding obligations and other pertinent actions.

Moreover, the COMPANY has the responsibility of appointing a successor ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT with the written consent of the current agent. Throughout this relationship, both parties engage in a diligent exchange of information related to terms, payments, and compliance requirements, underscoring the importance of collaboration</data>
  <data key="d7">"8"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agent-Company Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Appointment"&lt;SEP&gt;"Certification"&lt;SEP&gt;"Collaborative Decision Making"&lt;SEP&gt;"Communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"Compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"Consent Process"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"Oversight Engagement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment"&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Representation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Transaction Processing"&lt;SEP&gt;"agency, representation"&lt;SEP&gt;"agreement administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"documentation request"&lt;SEP&gt;"fiduciary role"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"loan management"&lt;SEP&gt;"management relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification"&lt;SEP&gt;5&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration\</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-114048bd63b08e08234db8c9890cd85e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-231a0d0a9307dfd95b4523972c93623b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6591c56671bab439c19567c096b29261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb201d631d7848d67d10aae35e099b65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6dda991dc457e11db2c6f0fe242fa41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d76442dc7c26385612da21161d48e29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787299885ac70dd86e4f90a80cc13d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e512310577a496a30e98195826f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd240b40422f73cdf615b12afee971f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d019c3df8aed44c5ff8ea4da836ddf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d84235c02ed2cf616010c0ffce2449b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd320686a1f984b7fbe703eddfa1995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f1e764a2d3e36453f112d7fa49a7bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb02eac2287146277b8109a81d8e8163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7d90cabdbbe047cf55d273fcdc0759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222ae97c7f771b1a3946c9792829f5c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b637d0405cd4cb720fa5cc51c6eae36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a26a8f2185f90f4a7c53bd3079e8fb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20b44c273fd20453cc4c0f330dc46d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00fd675e8185a64b4366aef768b80130&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10aab01983c7602494d5f25b52cc07d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b7e5fb7ef25d62c32b6776f5ce5ec9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8b8425899884f5c78c8851e6e77ce4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54326f4acdff2aa7b9cbed3bcfd85041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d204affd1db47ef8495cc75bef03d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8890e5da0c89b8e12882c5f4bdf02be7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cfb0db06a049eea31abd2146d1fdd60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2812a7eb1995b6a4da755313fb50a5a8</data>
  <data key="d9">DOC-6651d386274d94a69cbc67e7a7e06bb2</data>
</edge>
